  "prefLabel": "Opt 301.01 Application Process",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Opt 301.01 Application Process.\n\n(a) Any person who is not licensed as an optometrist in any state or other jurisdiction and who wishes to apply for a license in New Hampshire shall do so by submitting the application required by Opt 301.02, and the application fees required by Plc 1001.08 and Plc 1002.37.\n\n(b) The application and supporting documents shall be processed in accordance with Plc 304.06 through Plc 304.11.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Opt 100) #5839, eff 6-17-94, EXPIRED: 6-17-00\n\nNew. #7370, INTERIM, eff 9-30-00, EXPIRED: 3-29-01\n\nNew. #7670, eff 4-4-02, EXPIRED: 4-4-10\n\nNew. #9756, eff 7-20-10; ss by #12383, eff 9-16-17; ss by #14242, eff 6-21-25, EXPIRES: 6-21-35",
